951:So there's also so much to learn about making and drinking tea. I really do have a lot to learn.
952:If you're interested, would you like to learn the orthodox tea ceremony from me?
953:Based on what I know about you, the next thing you'll say is, "if you want to learn this from me, you'll need to go to college first." Am I right?
955:Haha, that really is what I had planned...
956:Oh no, nyaa--{var:Shake}
957:Ichihime suddenly runs back in a panic.
958:The expired ingredients that I told Master to throw away are still in the kitchen, but all the fresh ingredients are gone, nyaa!
959:...Wait a minute. Are you telling me that the garbage I worked really hard to throw away outside just now actually isn't rubbish?
960:I mixed them up, nyaa...
961:Oh well, the apologetic look in her eyes tells me that she must be feeling guilty about this. I should just forgive her.
962:Nyaa... This is such a rare opportunity to eat a meal cooked by Riu. This is terrible, nyaa!
963:!!! I knew it!!!
964:Let's all calm down. The scheduled third round can't proceed now. The first professional maid skills contest of Mahjong Soul Shrine is going to fall apart, woof.
