970:I admit defeat.
971:I was so anxious before because I was worried that you would make a bad life decision due to a lack of proper consideration, but our interactions today have shown me that I've been too narrow-minded.
972:Although you won't be continuing your studies in college, you have a better idea of what you want to do with your life than your peers. Since you've managed to teach yourself so many skills, you've already shown that you're more motivated and self-disciplined than most people.
973:I'm sorry. I had some misunderstandings about your career. I won't interfere with your decisions anymore. Just do whatever you want.
974:Mr. Makiki...
