984:After tasting the milk tea, Mr. Makiki says he has something else to do and says goodbye to us. After that, rain falls suddenly, sweeping away the mugginess of summer and doing our outdoor cleaning work for us, which means our cleaning session is now over.
985:This is great! To be honest, I'm already a little sleepy, woof. My friend, please make yourself at home here with Miss Kujou, woof.
