1042:I'm sorry, Mr. Makiki. I agree with Ichihime, so I'm going to vote for Riu.
1043:Riu has won two rounds now, nyaa.
1044:It's best out of three, so Miss Kujou is the winner, woof.
1045:Sigh, okay then. I guess I really don't understand the preferences of you young people. You win, Kujou.
1046:Unexpectedly, Riu Kujou doesn't look very happy after winning.
1047:Although I won based on the number of votes I got, I didn't realize that there's still so much to learn about the art of making tea. Mr. Makiki, I've still got a lot to learn.
1048:Haha, since you have this awareness, it means that I haven't come here in vain today. Well, I'm a man of my word, so I won't try to persuade you to go to college again since I lost.
1049:But no matter what you do, I hope you can look further ahead and keep learning to keep improving.
