1056:Hello, it's me, Mr. Makiki... Hello? ...What!? Skipping classes and failing tests, and now you're hanging up on me! I'm going to teach you a good lesson!
1057:Mr. Makiki, who seemed a little sad before, hangs up the phone and suddenly seems to be motivated again. He angrily scans a QR code to hire a rental bicycle and rushes off.
