1061:Of course not. Although he doesn't understand my decision right now, I'm confident that I'll become a student he'll be proud of from the bottom of his heart in the future. Come on, cleaning the Mahjong Soul Shrine is just the beginning! Let's clean the outdoor areas in the afternoon!
